h1 &nbsp;Contact our website
h2 This Contact Form is for classmates (for the graduation years supported) of Wintersville HS. It is to be used for them to provide changes to their Reference Document (Bio). It is also to be used to provide contact information (email, phone, address) about them, that is kept hidden and private. And most IMPORTANT it is to be used to send contact information about classmates that have a Status of Lost. If you have any information about our Lost classmates, please use this form to give us that information.  
h3 &nbsp
h3 This is a brand-new website, so you WILL be experiencing problems. Please help us out by describing any problems, concerns, and improvements via this Contact Form.
h3 If you would like to create a website for your school, read the User's Guide from the menu at the left.
